# Build context of the API image (docker-compose*.yml: context ".", dockerfile apps/api/Dockerfile).
# The image needs apps/api, demo and docs/evidence only. Secrets and local state never enter an image.
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/*.egg-info
**/node_modules
apps/web
contracts
packages
tests
deployments
docs/evidence/screenshots
